OL,3,GNEWSAScottish showjumper reported to be
OL,4,Ainvolved in fatal Spanish crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish Olympic medallist is
OL,7,Freported to have been involved in a
OL,8,Ffatal road accident in Spain.
OL,10,FAccording to Spanish media, a motorbike
OL,11,Fcollided with the side of a car being
OL,12,Fdriven by showjumper Scott Brash in
OL,13,FValencia on Thursday 8 October.
OL,15,FThe 20-year-old who was riding the
OL,16,Fmotorbike died at the scene.
OL,18,FBrash, 40, won gold medals in the team
OL,19,Fjumping events at both the 2012 and
OL,20,F2024 Olympics.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
